# MAX lottery tests (old export), 2001-12-31..2025-06-27
Formations on the fixed calendar: 270; complete 21-day holding periods: 245
Units: % per 21-day period ("a month"); t = Newey-West (4 lags) with plain t in brackets; alpha = intercept on compounded FF5 + UMD factors over the same 21 days (NW t, plain t, periods with factors).

